    "type": "game",
    "name": "Last Harvest",
    "steam_appid": 3435500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, chaotic roguelike where farming is life but the crops bite back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435500/extras/f0da89329c937a2204a2cb7c93929008.poster.avif?t=1747334264\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435500/extras/f0da89329c937a2204a2cb7c93929008.webm?t=1747334264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435500/extras/f0da89329c937a2204a2cb7c93929008.mp4?t=1747334264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with three, weird on purpose, and packed with just enough chaos to keep you planting. Expect around 30 minutes of frantic, farming-fueled fun, replayable with randomization and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelike farming adventure, you\u2019ll grow humble crops like tomatoes, corn, and carrots... while fending off waves of mutated monsters that really don\u2019t want you harvesting in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run, you\u2019ll explore, plant, and upgrade your character while using your harvest to buy items. Eventually, you\u2019ll face off with the Avocado of Doom, and probably get mauled by a carrot rhino along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started as a project between friends turned into a solo dev mission under Sand Squid Games \u2014 now finished, slightly unhinged, and just a few euros.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435500/extras/cae637f2045dadc56038239f797eb0d6.poster.avif?t=1747334264\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435500/extras/cae637f2045dadc56038239f797eb0d6.webm?t=1747334264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435500/extras/cae637f2045dadc56038239f797eb0d6.mp4?t=1747334264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Plant-to-Fight Gameplay \u2013 Want more money? Plant more crops. But every seed you plant means more monsters next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Procedural Generation \u2013 Levels shuffle each time. Navigate to fields, dodge enemies, and try not to get cornered by mutant Bok choy bunnies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e Mutant Monsters Galore \u2013 Carrotified rhinos. Psychotic mushrooms. And the final boss: a very angry avocado. This farm is not normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Buy Items \u2013 Buy items like the bat on a stick or a broken vacuum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d Built for Short, Punchy Runs \u2013 No fluff. Just fast action, silly upgrades, and a new excuse to yell at vegetables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Controls - Simple keyboard and mouse controls \u2013 use scroll to switch between crops and other than that WASD, E, F and a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, chaotic roguelike where farming is life but the crops bite back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435500/extras/f0da89329c937a2204a2cb7c93929008.poster.avif?t=1747334264\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435500/extras/f0da89329c937a2204a2cb7c93929008.webm?t=1747334264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435500/extras/f0da89329c937a2204a2cb7c93929008.mp4?t=1747334264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with three, weird on purpose, and packed with just enough chaos to keep you planting. Expect around 30 minutes of frantic, farming-fueled fun, replayable with randomization and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelike farming adventure, you\u2019ll grow humble crops like tomatoes, corn, and carrots... while fending off waves of mutated monsters that really don\u2019t want you harvesting in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run, you\u2019ll explore, plant, and upgrade your character while using your harvest to buy items. Eventually, you\u2019ll face off with the Avocado of Doom, and probably get mauled by a carrot rhino along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started as a project between friends turned into a solo dev mission under Sand Squid Games \u2014 now finished, slightly unhinged, and just a few euros.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435500/extras/cae637f2045dadc56038239f797eb0d6.poster.avif?t=1747334264\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435500/extras/cae637f2045dadc56038239f797eb0d6.webm?t=1747334264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435500/extras/cae637f2045dadc56038239f797eb0d6.mp4?t=1747334264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Plant-to-Fight Gameplay \u2013 Want more money? Plant more crops. But every seed you plant means more monsters next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Procedural Generation \u2013 Levels shuffle each time. Navigate to fields, dodge enemies, and try not to get cornered by mutant Bok choy bunnies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e Mutant Monsters Galore \u2013 Carrotified rhinos. Psychotic mushrooms. And the final boss: a very angry avocado. This farm is not normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Buy Items \u2013 Buy items like the bat on a stick or a broken vacuum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d Built for Short, Punchy Runs \u2013 No fluff. Just fast action, silly upgrades, and a new excuse to yell at vegetables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Controls - Simple keyboard and mouse controls \u2013 use scroll to switch between crops and other than that WASD, E, F and a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Grow crops. Fight monsters. Sell veggies for cash and battle a terrifying avocado in this roguelike farming game gone wrong. Weird, fast-paced, and full of mutated chaos \u2014 brought to life by a small indie team under Sand Squid Games.",
